  "details": "When using Horizon Adjust in combination with Height Adjust, changing worlds or switching avatars causes Height Adjust to revert to default.\n\n~Steps to Reproduce~\n\n- Enable Horizon Adjust.\n\n- Use Height Adjust to raise yourself higher.\n\n- Change to a different world or switch to another avatar.\n\nIn my use case, while lying down and using Horizon Adjust and Height Adjust, whenever I switch worlds or change avatars, Horizon Adjust persists but my height adjustment resets and I'll be in the ground.",
